{"page":130,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:19","surah":6,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ أَىُّ شَىْءٍ أَكْبَرُ شَهَـٰدَةً ۖ قُلِ ٱللَّهُ ۖ شَهِيدٌۢ بَيْنِى وَبَيْنَكُمْ ۚ وَأُوحِىَ إِلَىَّ هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانُ لِأُنذِرَكُم بِهِۦ وَمَنۢ بَلَغَ ۚ أَئِنَّكُمْ لَتَشْهَدُونَ أَنَّ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ ءَالِهَةً أُخْرَىٰ ۚ قُل لَّآ أَشْهَدُ ۚ قُلْ إِنَّمَا هُوَ إِلَـٰهٌ وَٰحِدٌ وَإِنَّنِى بَرِىٓءٌ مِّمَّا تُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘What counts most as a witness?’ Say, ‘God is witness between you and me. This Quran was revealed for me to warn you [people] and everyone it reaches. Do you really bear witness that there are other gods beside God?’ Say, ‘I myself do not bear witness [to any such thing].’ Say, ‘He is only one God, and I disown whatever you join with Him.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَىُّ","en_gloss":"What","transliteration":"ayyu","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"شَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَكْبَرُ","en_gloss":"(is) greatest","transliteration":"akbaru","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"شَهَـٰدَةًۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"(as) a testimony","transliteration":"shahādatan","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قُلِ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"quli","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"شَهِيدٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) Witness","transliteration":"shahīdun","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَيْنِى","en_gloss":"between me","transliteration":"baynī","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَبَيْنَكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"and between you","transliteration":"wabaynakum","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأُوحِىَ","en_gloss":"and has been revealed","transliteration":"waūḥiya","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَىَّ","en_gloss":"to me","transliteration":"ilayya","verse_key":"6:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hād